usage: aiopsctl plugin new <registry> <id> [--lang go] [--contrib] [--against <dist.yaml>] [--plugin <id>]...

Write a new plugin from the template of a registry, or a connector pack of a release.

Flags:
  --lang go              the language of the plugin
  --contrib              write the plugin under the owner contrib
  --against <dist.yaml>  the published signed manifest of the release to check against
  --plugin <id>          an instantiable plugin of the release that a connector pack rows

Exit codes:
  0  success, or help that was asked for
  1  a denial, a failed step, rebuild-required, an interrupt or a failed boot; the reason is on stderr
  2  a usage error; a Go panic outside every fiber also exits 2, with the trace of the runtime
